sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Source as Order source
  participant Registrar as StockOperationRegistrar
  participant Selection as StockOperationAssignmentCandidateFinder
  participant Planner as MovementAssignmentPlanner
  participant Assign as StockAllocationCommitter
  participant Move as StockOperationStore + StockMoveStore
  participant Quant as StockQuantStore
  participant Outbox as Transactional Outbox
  participant WMS as WMS Inbox

  Source->>Registrar: register canonical source snapshot
  Registrar->>Move: create CONFIRMED operation + ordered moves
  Registrar-->>Source: existing or new stockOperationId
  Source->>Selection: evaluate confirmed operation
  Selection-->>Source: optional earlier shared-SKU predecessor

  alt blocked or insufficient
    Source->>Planner: plan immutable moves + FEFO quants
    Planner-->>Source: missing quantities; no proposed move lines
    Note over Source,Move: same confirmed operation/moves remain durable
  else complete proposal
    Source->>Planner: plan immutable moves + FEFO quants
    Planner-->>Source: exact proposed move lines
    Source->>Assign: commit allocation proposal
    Note over Assign,Outbox: one local transaction
    Assign->>Move: lock operation, then ordered moves
    Assign->>Selection: recheck predecessor
    Assign->>Quant: lock globally ordered quants; recheck ATP
    Assign->>Quant: reserved += quantity
    Assign->>Move: create move lines; states = ASSIGNED
    Assign->>Outbox: operation + move + quant allocations
    Outbox-->>WMS: at-least-once v3 assignment fact
    WMS->>WMS: idempotent Shipment by stockOperationId
  end
